</div>

Liberal Result : [+ lps_weyburn +]%

CCF Result : [+ ccf_weyburn +]%



@ccf_wins_weyburn
title: The CCF Wins Weyburn
on-arrival: thatcher_ammunition -= 0.05

Perhaps this result was to be expected. A sign of good times, perhaps?

@lps_wins_weyburn
title: The LPS Wins Weyburn
on-arrival: thatcher_ammunition += 0.05; lps_seats += 1; ccf_seats -= 1

In an upset victory, the LPS has taken control of Douglas' old riding. Certainly, this whole affair has given Thatcher's Liberals more media attention. Increasingly, Socred voters, it seems, are moving over to the LPS. 